// Cross-domain constraint in webgme-lean .wgl dialect.
// Vocabulary mixes Sequence + Architecture aspect META with Integrating correspondences.
// This file is the human/DSL form; Example.lean is the Lean encoding + proof.

constraintset S1ParticipantBinds for IntegratedModel

// Every sequence Participant must correspond (sameAs) to an Architecture Service
// (or C4 Container). Participants and services are aspect instances; the link
// lives in the Integrating Language.

constraint ParticipantBindsArchitecture [error]
forall p in Participant:
  exists s in Service:
    corresponds(p, s, "sameAs")
